  "metadata": "Last modified on Feb 24, 2017",
  "content": "\n                    <div class=\"plugin-tabmeta-details\"><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"wrapped confluenceTable\"><colgroup><col><col></colgroup><tbody><tr><th class=\"confluenceTh\">Target release</th><td class=\"confluenceTd\">Release 1.0</td></tr><tr><th class=\"confluenceTh\">Document owner</th><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><div class=\"content-wrapper\"><p><a class=\"confluence-userlink user-mention\" data-username=\"bromansky\" href=\"https://wiki.campllc.org/display/~bromansky\" data-linked-resource-id=\"19203707\" data-linked-resource-version=\"2\" data-linked-resource-type=\"userinfo\" data-base-url=\"https://wiki.campllc.org/\">Brian Romansky</a></p></div></td></tr><tr><th class=\"confluenceTh\">Reviewer</th><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><div class=\"content-wrapper\"><p><a class=\"confluence-userlink user-mention\" data-username=\"rsingoria\" href=\"https://wiki.campllc.org/display/~rsingoria\" data-linked-resource-id=\"11502117\" data-linked-resource-version=\"2\" data-linked-resource-type=\"userinfo\" data-base-url=\"https://wiki.campllc.org/\">Rekha Singoria</a>, <a class=\"confluence-userlink user-mention\" data-username=\"wwhyte\" href=\"https://wiki.campllc.org/display/~wwhyte\" data-linked-resource-id=\"1081934\" data-linked-resource-version=\"2\" data-linked-resource-type=\"userinfo\" data-base-url=\"https://wiki.campllc.org/\">William Whyte</a>, <a class=\"confluence-userlink user-mention\" data-username=\"nebeid\" href=\"https://wiki.campllc.org/display/~nebeid\" data-linked-resource-id=\"3506582\" data-linked-resource-version=\"2\" data-linked-resource-type=\"userinfo\" data-base-url=\"https://wiki.campllc.org/\">Nevine Ebeid</a></p></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><h2 id=\"Step11.2.1-RevokeMA-Goals\">Goals</h2><p>The goal is to revoke an MA certificate from the SCMS System.</p><h2 id=\"Step11.2.1-RevokeMA-BackgroundandStrategicFit\">Background and Strategic Fit</h2><p>The Technical Component of the SCMS Manager (TCotSCMSM) determines that the Misbehavior Authority (MA) needs to be revoked. It will request that the <abbr title=\"Certificate Revocation List Generator\">CRLG</abbr> add the MA certificate to <abbr title=\"Certificate Revocation List\">CRL</abbr> and immediately issue a new CRL. The CRLG will cease to accept new requests signed by the MA. On receipt of the new CRL, all <abbr title=\"Pseudonym Certificate Authorities\">PCAs</abbr>, <abbr title=\"Registration Authorities\">RAs</abbr>, and <abbr title=\"Linkage Authorities\">LAs</abbr> will cease to accept new requests signed by the revoked MA.</p><p>The TCotSCMSM activates the replacement MA as described in <a href=\"Step-11.1.1---Add-MA_27427229.html\">Step 11.1.1 - Add MA</a>.</p><h2 id=\"Step11.2.1-RevokeMA-Assumptions\">Assumptions</h2><p>The TCotSCMSM will recover information on any active investigations underway when the MA was revoked. &nbsp;Trusted data will be copied to a replacement MA and those investigations will continue. &nbsp;</p><div class=\"scroll-title-macro\"><span class=\"confluence-anchor-link\" id=\"Step11.2.1-RevokeMA-\"></span><div class=\"scroll-title-body\"><p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</p><div class=\"scroll-title-macro-title\"></div></div>\n                    </div>\n\n                                        <div class=\"pageSection group\">\n                        <div class=\"pageSectionHeader\">\n                            <h2 id=\"attachments\" class=\"pageSectionTitle\">Attachments:</h2>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"greybox\">\n                                                            <img src=\"images/icons/bullet_blue.gif\" height=\"8\" width=\"8\" alt=\"\">\n                                <a href=\"attachments/27427285/27427286.png\">Untitled17.png</a> (image/png)\n                                <br>\n                                                    </div>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                               